Modified for Galaxy on 2026-10-15: custom shared page shell, message-based title,
original Galaxy favicon, plain language links, and removal of the locale dropdown.
The original session-checking and authentication-support scripts are retained.

The generated login template combines this head with Galaxy layout and form
presentation. Unmodified form templates and their resources are inherited from
the installed Keycloak parent theme and are not vendored by this package.

